    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>September 19</strong> is a dark adult visual novel with a strong focus on narrative, moral choices, and emotional depth. Players will follow the journey of a young woman who finds herself in a strange and dangerous world after being betrayed by those closest to her.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3599900/extras/eef08dec6dade9a73eb0605754df6ddf.avif?t=1747060493\" width=800 height=179 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A system of complex moral choices that affect the story, relationships, and multiple endings.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The ability to build and develop relationships with key characters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mini-games and in-game mechanics, including reaction-based challenges, puzzles, and stealth scenes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An atmospheric visual style that blends dark aesthetics with cinematic storytelling.</p></li></ul>",
